-- CAN'T ASSIGN TO THIS ----------------------------------------- main.kl  K0710

The left side of `=` has to be a place: a variable, optionally followed by `.field` or `[index]`, whose root was declared with `var`. This is a computed value, so there is nowhere to store the result.

9│     total(xs) = 3
       ^^^^^^^^^

Help: Bind the value to a new name with `let` instead, or assign to the variable the value came from.

Learn more: kalam explain K0710
